      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
         "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>If the target is unaware of the Gloomhaunt's presence, the Gloomhaunt may use this as part of a Charge Attack. It must make an opposed Stealth test against the target's Awareness. If it fails, it may attempt to grapple as normal. If it succeeds, it only needs to hit the target with a melee test (with Advantage as per the Charge attack) to initiate a grapple, which cannot be avoided.</p>"
        },
