      "system": {
        "notes": {
         "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>The Gloomhaunt will always attempt to Grapple its opponent, targeting the target's Head location. The Gloomhaunt counts as having a Strength Bonus of 6 during a Grapple, and the target counts as Suffocating. Someone not involved in the grapple may attack the Gloomhaunt by instead attacking the grappled target; damage is divided equally between the Gloomhaunt and the target (the Gloomhaunt's share is rounded up).</p>"
